# 🧪 LabLens

**AI-Powered Medical Report Analysis & Visualization**

LabLens is a web application that helps users understand medical reports in a simple and visual way. Users can upload medical reports in **PDF format**, and LabLens extracts the report data, analyzes test results, identifies abnormal values, and presents the information through an easy-to-understand interface.

> ⚠️ **Disclaimer:** LabLens is an educational/informational tool and is **not a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.**

---

## ✨ Features

* 📄 Upload medical reports in PDF format
* 🔍 Extract text and test information from reports
* 🤖 AI-powered medical report data extraction using Google Gemini
* 📊 Analyze laboratory parameters and their status
* 🟢 Identify normal values
* 🟡 Identify values that may require attention
* 🔴 Identify abnormal/high/low values
* 💡 Generate easy-to-understand insights
* 📈 Visualize report information
* 🗂️ Maintain medical report/history information
* 💻 Responsive web interface

---

