# 📌 Important Git Files

The repository should contain:

```text
README.md
.gitignore
backend/requirements.txt
frontend/package.json
```

These files allow another developer to recreate the development environment.

---

# 📝 Before Pushing to GitHub

Make sure you **DO NOT** push:

```text
.env
venv/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
uploads/
*.pyc
```

A recommended `.gitignore`:

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo

# Virtual environment
venv/
env/
.venv/

# Environment variables
.env
.env.*

# Uploaded files
uploads/

# Node
node_modules/
dist/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
```

